    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "JEN/mrs\n-\nUNITED AIRLInES\nSpace permitting, reply at bottom of page\nToSFOSW - Don Attix\nKate McNamara\nKimberly Hauschild-Westermark\nSFOSW - Karen Burke\nEXOSW - Bob Ernst\nSFOSW - Patrick Ryan\nSFOFS - Dave Walkinshaw\nFrom EXOSW - Janice Northcott\nSeptember 18, 1981\nThank you for your willingness to assist Flight Safety and\nInflight Services in the 737 evacuation demonstration at\nthe Maintenance Operations Center on September 11, 1981.\nYour participation in the demonstration for the FAA was\nmost appreciated. As you know, United passed the test of\nopening 50% of the exits and deploying the slides within\n15 seconds. Our actual time was 9 seconds, thanks to your\nprofessionalism.\nPlease accept the thanks of the Inflight Services Standards\n\u0026 Safety Staff.\nma nodkutt\nJanice Northcott\nUG\n1 REV.\n2 - 76\nU.S. A."
    ],
